      "title": "Florida pastor found guilty over 2021 assassination of Haitian president",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/18/florida-pastor-guilty-haiti-president-assassination",
      "description": "<p>Christian Emmanuel Sanon faces life in prison after conviction on charges arising from killing of Jovenel Moïse</p><p>A Florida pastor with dual Haitian-American citizenship was convicted on Wednesday of US charges arising from the 2021 assassination of the Haitian president Jovenel Moïse.</p><p>Christian Emmanuel Sanon was found guilty on charges including conspiring to kill Moïse after a nearly eight-week trial in federal court in Miami. He had faced a total of eight charges including conspiracy to kidnap or kill a person outside the United States.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/18/florida-pastor-guilty-haiti-president-assassination\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
